/><td>&#x000a0;33 &#x000b1; 22</td><td/><td>771 &#x000b1; 447</td><td/><td>1,321 &#x000b1; 700</td></tr><tr><td align="left">Anti-CD4 (&#x02212;1,&#x0002b;7)</td><td/><td align="left">PBS</td><td/><td>&#x0003c;1.56</td><td/><td>&#x0003c;15.6</td><td/><td>&#x0003c;0.23</td><td/><td>&#x0003c;0.23</td></tr><tr><td align="left">Anti-CD8 (&#x02212;1,&#x0002b;7)</td><td/><td align="left">PBS</td><td/><td>&#x0003c;1.56</td><td/><td>263 &#x000b1; 40</td><td/><td>&#x0003c;0.23</td><td/><td>&#x02009;&#x02009;&#x02009;259 &#x000b1; 67</td></tr><tr><td align="left">Anti-CD8 (<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="B20">20</xref>, <xref ref-type="bibr" rid="B34">34</xref>)</td><td/><td align="left">PBS</td><td/><td>&#x0003c;1.56</td><td/><td>244 &#x000b1; 60</td><td/><td>&#x0003c;0.23</td><td/><td>&#x02009;&#x02009;&#x02009;192 &#x000b1; 36</td></tr><tr><td align="left">GL113 (&#x02212;1,&#x0002b;7)</td><td/><td align="left">PBS</td><td/><td>&#x0003c;1.56</td><td/><td>169 &#x000b1; 61</td><td/><td>&#x0003c;0.23</td><td/><td>&#x02009;&#x02009;&#x02009;383 &#x000b1; 73</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn><p>2&#x000b0; 10 &#x003bc;g OVA/AL IP on day 21. 3&#x000b0; 1% Aerosolized OVA on day 35.          &#x000a0;</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap position="float" id="T3"><label>Table 3</label><caption><p>IgE and IgG1 Anti-OVA Response in Wild-type and TCR-&#x003b4;&#x02212;/&#x02212; Mice After Exposure to OVA</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th align="left">Mice</th><th/><th>Primary exposure</th><th/><th>IgE Day 7 after 3&#x000b0;</th><th/><th>IgG1 Day 7 after 3&#x000b0;</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left"/><td/><td align="left"/><td/><td><italic>ng/ml</italic></td><td/><td><italic>&#x003bc;g/ml</italic></td></tr><tr><td align="left">Wild-type</td><td/><td align="left">1% Aerosolized OVA day 0&#x02013;9</td><td/><td align="left">&#x000a0;15 &#x000b1; 8</td><td/><td>&#x02009;&#x02009;&#x02009;142 &#x000b1; 61</td></tr><tr><td align="left">TCR-&#x003b4;&#x02212;/&#x02212;</td><td/><td align="left">1% Aerosolized OVA day 0&#x02013;9</td><td/><td align="left">&#x000a0;&#x000a0;5 &#x000b1; 0.5</td><td/><td>&#x000a0;&#x02009;&#x02009;&#x02009;310 &#x000b1; 213</td></tr><tr><td align="left">Wild-type</td><td/><td align="left">PBS</td><td/><td align="left">188 &#x000b1; 132</td><td/><td>&#x02009;&#x02009;&#x02009;233 &#x000b1; 65</td></tr><tr><td align="left">TCR-&#x003b4;&#x02212;/&#x02212;</td><td/><td align="left">PBS</td><td/><td align="left">144 &#x000b1; 73</td><td/><td>&#x000a0;&#x02009;&#x02009;&#x02009;694 &#x000b1; 153</td></tr><tr><td align="left">Wild-type</td><td/><td align="left">10 &#x003bc;g OVA/AL, day 0</td><td/><td align="left">600 &#x000b1; 275</td><td/><td>1,268 &#x000b1; 413</td></tr><tr><td align="left">TCR-&#x003b4;&#x02212;/&#x02212;</td><td/><td align="left">10 &#x003bc;g OVA/AL, day 0</td><td/><td align="left">713 &#x000b1; 412</td><td/><td>1,283 &#x000b1; 419</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn><p>2&#x000b0; 10 &#x003bc;g OVA/AL IP on day 19. 3&#x000b0; 1% Aerosolized OVA on day 44.      &#x000a0;</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><fig position="float" id="F3"><label>Figure 3</label><caption><p>Blood eosinophils in OVA-sensitized mice. &#x025a1;, Wild-type, <inline-graphic xlink:href="diag4.gif"/> , &#x003b2;<sub>2</sub>m&#x02212;&#x0002f;&#x02212;, and &#x025aa;,  IFN-&#x003b3;&#x02212;&#x0002f;&#x02212; BALB/c mice were bled from the  tail vein on day 4 after the tertiary exposure and  the eosinophils were counted in Discombe's  fluid on a hemacytometer (<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="B18">18</xref>). Data represent  the mean (&#x000b1; SEM) eosinophil counts per milliliter in groups of five mice.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="JEM971641.f3"/></fig><table-wrap position="float" id="T4"><label>Table 4</label><caption><p>Cytokine Production After In Vitro Restimulation of Lung Cells from Aerosol-exposed Wild-type, &#x003b2;2m&#x02212;/&#x02212; and IFN-&#x003